    "saniye": 2.245,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "By harry quilter m a."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-135031-0009",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 1.91,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "He doesn't work at all."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-135031-0012",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 2.04,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "Where is my brother now."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-135031-0011",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 3.18,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "Not exactly returned kaliko."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-135031-0018",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 2.445,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "Oh no i'm quite sure he didn't."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-135031-0021",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 2.595,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "I do not know confessed shaggy."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-135031-0013",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 3.7,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "Inquired shaggy in the metal forest."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-141231-0000",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 4.65,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "A man said to the universe sir i exist."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-135031-0019",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 3.525,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "That's funny remarked betsy thoughtfully."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-135031-0008",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 3.67,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "I hope he doesn't work too hard said shaggy."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-141231-0024",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 3.64,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "This is physically impossible when conscious."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-141231-0020",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 4.32,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "Just thrust and parry and victory to the stronger."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-128104-0012",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 5.38,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "Only unfortunately his own work never does get good."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-141231-0004",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 5.09,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "One minute a voice said and the time buzzer sounded."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-135031-0007",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 4.055,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "He eats and sleeps very steadily replied the new king."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-141231-0017",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 3.735,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "He asked the handler who was kneading his aching muscles."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-128104-0008",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 5.12,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "As for etchings they are of two kinds british and foreign."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-141231-0007",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 4.735,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "Only his heart and lungs worked on at a strong measured rate."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-141231-0008",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 4.595,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "He was in reverie sliding along the borders of consciousness."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-141231-0021",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 4.65,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "Every man who entered the twenties had his own training tricks."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-128104-0001",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 4.815,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "Nor is mister quilter's manner less interesting than his matter."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-141231-0028",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 5.65,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "Irolg looked amazed at the sudden fury of the attack then smiled."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-135031-0004",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 4.225,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "The king has fled in disgrace and your friends are asking for you."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-135031-0005",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 4.625,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "I begged ruggedo long ago to send him away but he would not do so."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-135031-0006",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 4.09,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "I also offered to help your brother to escape but he would not go."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-135031-0020",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 4.65,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "I don't believe ann knew any magic or she'd have worked it before."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-141231-0006",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 4.93,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "The buzzer's whirr triggered his muscles into complete relaxation."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-141231-0019",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 4.7,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "There could be little art in this last and final round of fencing."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-141231-0032",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 4.48,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "Then the powerful twist that thrust it aside in and under the guard."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-141231-0011",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 5.015,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "The other voice snapped with a harsh urgency clearly used to command."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-141231-0015",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 5.68,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "There was silence then and still wondering brion was once more asleep."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-141231-0003",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 5.42,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "His instant of panic was followed by a small sharp blow high on his chest."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-128104-0006",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 5.64,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "On the general principles of art mister quilter writes with equal lucidity."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-135031-0003",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 4.755,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "The little girl had been asleep but she heard the raps and opened the door."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-135031-0017",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 6.86,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "However if we look sharp we may be able to discover one of these secret ways."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-141231-0018",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 6.0,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "A red haired mountain of a man with an apparently inexhaustible store of energy."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-128104-0010",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 5.6,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "Near the fire and the ornaments fred brought home from india on the mantel board."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-141231-0005",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 5.81,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "A minute is not a very large measure of time and his body needed every fraction of it."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-141231-0029",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 6.88,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "He thought it was a last burst of energy he knew how close they both were to exhaustion."
   },
   {
    "id": "1272-141231-0026",
    "hz": 16000,
    "saniye": 6.635,
    "konusmaci": 1272,
    "metin": "Breathing deeply brion softly spoke the auto hypnotic phrases that triggered the process."
   }
